              commutes up to natural isomorphism. Adjectives ‘regular’, ‘singular’, ‘dimension-preserving’, ‘base-preserving’ apply if they apply to
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %munder
                        %mi F
